  "stories": [
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Profile",
        "zh": "客观履历",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Haze is an operator from Victoria, where she did time in an Infected quarantine lockup. She finally escaped after multiple attempts, eventually joining Rhodes Island under an alias.",
        "zh": "出身于维多利亚的干员，曾是被关入维多利亚感染隔离区监狱的感染者病患。在多次越狱后终获自由身，化名逃遁，并辗转加入罗德岛。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "DIRECT"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Clinical Analysis",
        "zh": "临床诊断分析",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Imaging tests for this Operator showed blurry outlines of internal organs with visible dark spots. Unusually high concentrations of Originium particles were present in her circulatory system, indicating infection and confirming her as Infected at this stage. \n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 16% \nNo visible signs of crystal formation, but comparatively worse internal contamination. \n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.36u/L \nInfection entering mid-stage, crystals are starting to enhance the host's Originium abilities.",
        "zh": "造影检测结果显示，该干员体内脏器轮廓模糊，可见异常阴影，循环系统内源石颗粒检测异常，有矿石病感染迹象，现阶段可确认为矿石病感染者。\n\n【体细胞与源石融合率】16%\n体表没有出现明显源石结晶，但体内污染较为严重。\n\n【血液源石结晶密度】0.36u/L\n感染步入中期，源石结晶开始增幅宿主的源石技艺。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "25"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 1",
        "zh": "档案资料一",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Haze is able to cast Dark Fog Arts, a spell unique to her. The versatile mist can obscure vision, damage, kill, or enhance Haze's own abilities.",
        "zh": "能够使用自己独有的黑雾法术。黑雾可以遮蔽视野、进行杀伤、或是强化夜烟自身的能力，运用方式多种多样。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "50"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 2",
        "zh": "档案资料二",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Haze has a habit of palming things from those around her. While she never steals money or keys, no trifling trinkets are safe with her around. Such trivial thievery wouldn't normally get anyone in serious trouble, but upon getting picked up for a minor infraction, her infection was discovered, so the authorities dumped her into a cell for the Infected.",
        "zh": "有着轻度偷盗癖，但一不拿钱二不偷钥匙，只会对一些无关紧要的小东西下手。本来这样的程度连立案都不会立，但因为一次行窃时被发现是感染者，于是立刻被抓捕并送进了感染者监狱。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "100"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 3",
        "zh": "档案资料三",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Her prison was especially built to hold Infected criminals. To break out and breathe free once more, she had to climb the towering quarantine wall and evade all security measures in between. Haze is the only one to have managed such a feat, with the Victorian Police still hunting her to this day.",
        "zh": "关押夜烟的监狱是专门用以收监感染者罪犯的特殊监狱，想要从这里逃出并获得自由，相当于要越过监狱与隔离区高墙并躲过所有搜查和追踪。做到这点的只有夜烟一人，所以时至今日，维多利亚警署仍在试图逮捕夜烟。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "150"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 4",
        "zh": "档案资料四",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Haze makes no secret of her fondness for feline Beast Stewards. Even though these same cute animals led to her infection, she still feeds and cares for them. So it's no surprise Haze gets along with other Felines like Mousse.",
        "zh": "夜烟从不掩饰自己对菲林兽亲们的喜爱。即使自己的感染和这些可爱的小生物有直接关系，夜烟却还是一如既往地饲养或喂食它们。因为这个原因，夜烟很喜欢同样可爱的菲林同族们，比如慕斯。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "200"
    }
  ]
}
